Yes, this occurs when an acquired Channel is released after the FixedChannelPool has been closed: 

``` Java
        // set up Bootstrap etc
        ... 
        FixedChannelPool pool = new FixedChannelPool(b, handler, maxConnections);
        final Future<Channel> acquire = pool.acquire();
        final Channel channel = acquire.get();
        pool.close();
        pool.release(channel);
```
